      <div class="dt__content" data-content="ship">
        <h3 class="dt__content-title">[ GLOBAL PRIORITY DISPATCH PROTOCOL ]</h3>
        <p class="dt__content-desc">
          All orders secured during this live countdown window are dispatched within 24 hours from our centralized fulfillment vaults in Tokyo and Mumbai via express air courier with signature required upon delivery.
        </p>
        <div class="dt__grid">
          <div class="dt__grid-item">
            <span class="dt__grid-lbl">DISPATCH SPEED:</span>
            <span class="dt__grid-val">WITHIN 24 HOURS OF DROP</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dt__grid-item">
            <span class="dt__grid-lbl">COURIER PARTNERS:</span>
            <span class="dt__grid-val">DHL EXPRESS / FEDEX PRIORITY</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dt__grid-item">
            <span class="dt__grid-lbl">PACKAGING:</span>
            <span class="dt__grid-val">PREMIUM WATERPROOF FOIL BAG</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dt__grid-item">
            <span class="dt__grid-lbl">TRACKING ASSAY:</span>
            <span class="dt__grid-val">REAL-TIME GPS TELEMETRY</span>
